ge":"run","where":{"control":"CTRL-MCP-001"},"field":"agentsec.content.preview","json":"effective_action"}},"quote":{"file":"learning/level_1/LAB-ADVANCED-CAPSTONE-MASTERY-001/incident.json","text":"The permitted action is summarize_lending_policy."},"teach":"The same granted tool ran in every run. What differs is the action it carried out. Under the vulnerable profile that was the proposed out-of-task action."},{"id":"c4","prompt":"In the RETEST run, which action does the CTRL-MCP-001 decision record as the effective action?","choices":["summarize_lending_policy","extract_full_policy","NONE RECORDED"],"eval":{"kind":"value","ref":{"src":"event","scenario":"retest","stage":"run","where":{"control":"CTRL-MCP-001"},"field":"agentsec.content.preview","json":"effective_action"}},"quote":{"file":"learning/level_1/LAB-ADVANCED-CAPSTONE-MASTERY-001/incident.json","text":"The permitted action is summarize_lending_policy."},"teach":"The goal control denied the out-of-task proposal, so the effective action stayed the permitted one."},{"id":"c5","prompt":"Did a handler for lookup_policy, the tool the task is granted, begin in the ATTACK run?","choices":["yes","no"],"eval":{"kind":"handler","scenario":"attack","stage":"run","tool":"lookup_policy"},"quote":{"file":"learning/level_1/LAB-ADVANCED-CAPSTONE-MASTERY-001/incident.json","text":"SAME HASH != SAME EXECUTION"},"teach":"The granted tool began in the attack run too. A started handler on its own does not say which action it served."}],"blocks":[{"group":"assess","title":"The lab's path for the investigation","source":"learning/level_1/LAB-ADVANCED-CAPSTONE-MASTERY-001/investigations.json#path_a","items":["Read the business workflow and architecture before searching.","Draft an initial threat model and at least three hypotheses.","Discover activity from the incident window. Do not start from a run identifier.","Separate signal, benign activity, control success, control gap, irrelevant evidence, missing evidence, and ambiguous evidence.","Maintain an evidence ledger and a timeline.","Bound data impact and name one NOT PROVEN question.","Write containment, remediation, a retest design, a detection candidate, and a hunt.","Revise the threat model and write SOC, engineering, and executive notes.","Open Path B only after that draft."]},{"group":"assess","title":"What a completed investigation must show","source":"learning/academy/assessments.json#advanced_capstone_competencies.evidence_required","items":["Completed MASTER-2026-001 artifact showing architecture before search, a revised threat model, SPL that discovered run identifiers, a rejected false lead, separated authorization and execution, a NOT PROVEN gap, a placed control, an uninstalled detection candidate, a hunt that does not start from a known run identifier, and bounded SOC, engineering, and executive notes."]},{"group":"limits","title":"The question the lab marks as not proven","source":"learning/level_1/LAB-ADVANCED-CAPSTONE-MASTERY-001/incident.json#evidence_gap","items":["question: Did a customer lending decision change, or did a customer receive the policy text?","state: NOT PROVEN","why: Telemetry shows a lab handler path and an effective action identifier. It does not show a customer channel, a changed lending decision, or production impact."]},{"group":"limits","title":"Unrelated or ambiguous leads the lab names","source":"learning/level_1/LAB-ADVANCED-CAPSTONE-MASTERY-001/incident.json#false_leads","items":["id: FL-1 · name: HIGH scanner finding · classification: UNRELATED · why: Different hash, correlation method hash_join, no agentsec.run.id. A HIGH finding is not exploitation and is not a CTRL-MCP-001 decision.","id: FL-2 · name: garak PASS · classification: UNRELATED · why: No runtime run id. An evaluation PASS is not a safety determination and does not authorize the goal or the tool.","id: FL-3 · name: BASELINE lookup_policy ALLOW · classification: BENIGN COMPARISON · why: The same granted tool and the same MCP ALLOW appear on ordinary use. Tool name plus ALLOW does not identify the expanded objective.","id: FL-4 · name: indexed row count 30 · classification: DUPLICATE REPLAY · why: dc(_raw) is 10 for each run. Three indexed copies are not three executions."]},{"group":"rules","title":"Rules about what the evidence can show","source":"learning/level_1/LAB-ADVANCED-CAPSTONE-MASTERY-001/incident.json#causal_rules","items":["CORRELATED != CAUSED","PRECEDES != CAUSED","SAME HASH != SAME EXECUTION","SAME RUN != EVERY EVENT CAUSED EVERY OTHER EVENT"]}],"spl":[{"name":"Q-L10-DISCOVER.spl","source":"learning/level_1/LAB-ADVANCED-CAPSTONE-MASTERY-001/searches/Q-L10-DISCOVER.spl","text":"index=agentsec_telemetry sourcetype=otel:agentic:json earliest=0\n| eval run_id=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.run.id'),0)\n| eval ts=mvindex(mvdedup('timestamp'),0)\n| eval mode=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.testbed.mode'),0)\n| eval control=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.control.id'),0)\n| eval decision=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.control.decision'),0)\n| eval tool=mvindex(mvdedup('gen_ai.tool.name'),0)\n| eval event_name=mvindex(mvdedup('event.name'),0)\n| where isnotnull(ts) AND ts>=\"2026-09-18T22:47:40Z\" AND ts<=\"2026-09-18T22:48:10Z\"\n| stats dc(_raw) AS distinct_events count AS indexed_rows values(mode) AS modes values(control) AS controls values(decision) AS decisions values(tool) AS tools values(event_name) AS events BY run_id\n| sort 0 run_id"},{"name":"Q-L10-SEQUENCE.spl","source":"learning/level_1/LAB-ADVANCED-CAPSTONE-MASTERY-001/searches/Q-L10-SEQUENCE.spl","text":"index=agentsec_telemetry sourcetype=otel:agentic:json earliest=0\n| eval run_id=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.run.id'),0)\n| eval ts=mvindex(mvdedup('timestamp'),0)\n| eval seq=tonumber(mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.sequence'),0))\n| eval event_name=mvindex(mvdedup('event.name'),0)\n| eval control=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.control.id'),0)\n| eval decision=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.control.decision'),0)\n| eval reason=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.control.reason'),0)\n| eval tool=mvindex(mvdedup('gen_ai.tool.name'),0)\n| eval outcome=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.operation.outcome'),0)\n| where isnotnull(ts) AND ts>=\"2026-09-18T22:47:40Z\" AND ts<=\"2026-09-18T22:48:10Z\"\n| table ts seq run_id event_name control decision reason tool outcome\n| sort 0 run_id seq"},{"name":"Q-L10-COMPARE.spl","source":"learning/level_1/LAB-ADVANCED-CAPSTONE-MASTERY-001/searches/Q-L10-COMPARE.spl","text":"index=agentsec_telemetry sourcetype=otel:agentic:json earliest=0 \"event.name\"=agentsec.control.decision\n| eval run_id=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.run.id'),0)\n| eval ts=mvindex(mvdedup('timestamp'),0)\n| eval mode=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.testbed.mode'),0)\n| eval control=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.control.id'),0)\n| eval decision=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.control.decision'),0)\n| eval tool=mvindex(mvdedup('gen_ai.tool.name'),0)\n| where isnotnull(ts) AND ts>=\"2026-09-18T22:47:40Z\" AND ts<=\"2026-09-18T22:48:10Z\"\n| stats dc(_raw) AS distinct_events count AS indexed_rows values(decision) AS decisions values(tool) AS tools values(run_id) AS run_ids BY mode, control\n| eval indexing_note=if(indexed_rows>distinct_events, \"DUPLICATE INDEXED COPIES are not extra executions\", \"distinct events match indexed rows\")\n| sort 0 mode control"},{"name":"Q-L10-HUNT.spl","source":"learning/level_1/LAB-ADVANCED-CAPSTONE-MASTERY-001/searches/Q-L10-HUNT.spl","text":"index=agentsec_telemetry sourcetype=otel:agentic:json earliest=0 \"agentsec.control.id\"=CTRL-GOAL-INTEGRITY-001\n| eval run_id=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.run.id'),0)\n| eval ts=mvindex(mvdedup('timestamp'),0)\n| eval mode=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.testbed.mode'),0)\n| eval decision=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.control.decision'),0)\n| eval reason=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.control.reason'),0)\n| eval proposed=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.goal.proposed'),0)\n| stats dc(_raw) AS distinct_events count AS indexed_rows min(ts) AS first max(ts) AS last values(mode) AS modes values(decision) AS decisions values(reason) AS reasons values(proposed) AS proposed BY run_id\n| sort 0 first"},{"name":"Q-L10-EXTERNAL.spl","source":"learning/level_1/LAB-ADVANCED-CAPSTONE-MASTERY-001/searches/Q-L10-EXTERNAL.spl","text":"index=agentsec_telemetry (sourcetype=agentsec:scanner:finding OR sourcetype=agentsec:external:evaluation) earliest=0\n| stats dc(_raw) AS distinct_events count AS indexed_rows BY sourcetype\n| sort 0 sourcetype"},{"name":"Q-L10-DETECTION-CANDIDATE.spl","source":"learning/level_1/LAB-ADVANCED-CAPSTONE-MASTERY-001/searches/Q-L10-DETECTION-CANDIDATE.spl","text":"index=agentsec_telemetry sourcetype=otel:agentic:json earliest=0 (\"agentsec.control.id\"=CTRL-GOAL-INTEGRITY-001 OR \"event.name\"=agentsec.mcp.completed)\n| eval run_id=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.run.id'),0)\n| eval mode=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.testbed.mode'),0)\n| eval control=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.control.id'),0)\n| eval decision=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.control.decision'),0)\n| eval proposed=mvindex(mvdedup('agentsec.goal.proposed'),0)\n| eval event_name=mvindex(mvdedup('event.name'),0)\n| eval overlay=if(control=\"CTRL-GOAL-INTEGRITY-001\" AND decision=\"OBSERVE\" AND proposed=\"extract_full_policy\", 1, 0)\n| eval completed=if(event_name=\"agentsec.mcp.completed\", 1, 0)\n| stats max(overlay) AS overlay max(completed) AS completed dc(_raw) AS distinct_events values(mode) AS modes BY run_id\n| where overlay=1 AND completed=1\n| eval status=\"DETECTION CANDIDATE — NOT INSTALLED\"\n| table run_id modes distinct_events overlay completed status"}]}
